  "body": "## Problem\n\nDashboard currently tracks OpenCode, Codex CLI, and Hermes. Cursor is not represented, so usage totals and source provenance stay incomplete for users who rely on Cursor locally.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Add Cursor as a source only if local data is available\n- Keep provenance visible in UI and API responses\n- Preserve honest `unavailable` / missing-state behavior when Cursor data is not present\n- Do not invent or guess Cursor usage values\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- Cursor appears as a source when data exists\n- Source labels and provenance stay explicit\n- Missing Cursor data shows a clear unavailable state\n- Tests cover adapter and response-shaping behavior\n",
